-++---
-++title: "Avantis Plugin"
-++description: "Open and manage leveraged perpetual-futures positions on Avantis."
-++tags: [perps, leverage, trading, derivatives]
-++name: avantis
-++version: 0.2.0
-++integration: hybrid
-++chains: [base]
-++requires:
-++  shell: optional
