-++
-++1. `web_request` GET `https://www.clawn.ch/api/launches?limit=10`.
-++2. Surface the 10 launches with symbol, name, source/agent handle, age, address.
-++3. Do **not** auto-buy. Ask the user which one (and how much) they want.
