-++---
-++title: "Flaunch Plugin"
-++description: "Prepare Flaunch launches through mcp.flaunch.gg and submit them with Wallet MCP send_calls; discover and swap deployed tokens through Wallet MCP."
-++tags: [token-launches, memecoins, discovery, swap]
