-+++---
-+++title: "OpenSea Plugin"
-+++description: "NFT marketplace trading, token swaps, and drops/minting via OpenSea REST API + CLI → send_calls on Ethereum, Base, Polygon, Arbitrum, Optimism, and Avalanche."
