-+++| `yoloUSD` | ethereum | `0x5DD8BFa6C5C68D05d25EF6143E05C11E26c4cDB7` | 6       | USDC       | `0xA0b86991c6218b36c1d19D4a2e9Eb0cE3606eB48` |
